# Workflow definitions are LF on every machine, in the repository and in the
# working tree, whatever `core.autocrlf` is set to. They are read by the
# engine and reviewed as text, so a diff between two checkouts should be a
# diff in the workflow and never in the line endings.
#
# Nothing depends on this: a definition's hash is of its parsed, canonical
# form (`app/automation/library.py`), so the same definition hashes the same
# whatever bytes a checkout wrote. This keeps the files themselves one thing.
app/automation/definitions/*.yaml text eol=lf
